# Private keys layer_audit_keys (bin/layer-lib) lets into a layer: inert
# examples and test fixtures that packages ship, which no service reads and
# which are published with their package anyway. One "sha256 /path" per line.
#
# A key is listed here only after a person has read it and said why it is
# inert, and it is accepted only at this path with this digest: a package
# update that changes one fails the layer build until someone looks again.
# Anything a service could use belongs in removelists-final, never here
# (keel-core#8).
#
# Measured on the layer trees of 2026-09-26 to 2026-09-28 on the build host,
# with the pattern layer_audit_keys uses.

